  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Programmatic Trust Fund for Europe and Central Asia Public Finance Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS IS AN UMBRELLA PROGRAMMATIC TRUST FUND TO PROVIDE A FLEXIBLE  source of technical assistance financing on various dimensions of  public finance management (PFM) to individual ECA countries or groups  of countries on a needs basis. The main objective of this Trust Fund is to support improvements in  public financial management in Europe and Central Asia (ECA) (with  emphasis on IDA beneficiaries) as an important element of stronger  governance and improved conditions for economic and social development.</narrative>
  </description>
